  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\n**Given :** 11 * 7 * 345 * 5 * 31 = 115\n\nAccording to the question, by replacing the *signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : + × ÷ −\n\n11 + 7 × **345 ÷ 5**__ − 31 = 115\n\n11 + __**7 × 69**__ − 31 = 115\n\n__**11 + 483**__ - 31 = 115\n\n__**494 - 31**__ = 115\n\n463 ≠ 115 (LHS ≠ RHS) \n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : × + ÷ − \n\n11 × 7 + **345 ÷ 5**__ − 31 = 115\n\n__**11 ×**____** 7**__ + 69 - 31 = 115\n\n__**77 + 69**__ - 31 = 115\n\n__**146 - 31**__ = 115\n\n115 = 115 (LHS = RHS) \n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷ × + −\n\n**11 ÷ 7**__ × 345 + 5 − 31 = 115\n\n__**1.57 × 345**__ + 5 − 31 = 115\n\n__**541.65 + 5**__ - 31 = 115\n\n__**546.65 - 31**__ = 115\n\n515.65 ≠ 115 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ÷ − + ×\n\n**11 ÷ 7**__ − 345 + 5 × 31 = 115\n\n1.57 − 345 + __**5 **____**×**____** 31**__ = 115\n\n__**1.57 + 155**__ - 345 = 115\n\n__**156.57 - 345**__ = 115\n\n188.43 ≠ 115 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
